<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58780" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομέω</span></b>  (A), 
			Ep.
		
		impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κομέεσκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.390
				</span></i>
			:—
				Ep.
			 Verb, <i>take care of, tend</i>, in <i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i> of horses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτω μὲν θεράποντε κομείτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.109
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Ap.</u>
				236
			</span></i>; of dogs, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.310
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				319
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				604
			</span></i>; elsewh. in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i> always of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέροντα ἐνδυκέως κομέεσκεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.390
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.207
			</span></i>, etc.; of children, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺ δὲ τοὺς κομέειν ἀτιταλλέμεναί τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11.250
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούρην . . κομέουσι τοκῆες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.1335
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				1.567
			</span></i> (Karanis, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). (Prob. cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμνω</span>, q.v.)</div>
